# STRICT.md

Optional strict appendix. Read only when the user requests strict profile or the task is high risk.

## Extra stop guidance

Stop and ask before:

- New dependency installation.
- Database schema changes.
- CI/CD changes.
- Auth, permissions, billing, encryption, data retention, or migration changes not explicitly planned.
- Any command that writes outside the workspace.
- Any action that needs network access.

## Escalation format

```text
Triggered rule:
Evidence:
Options:
Recommendation:
Minimum human decision needed:
```

## Long-running process pattern

Never run dev servers in the foreground during agent work.

```bash
mkdir -p .codex_artifacts/logs
nohup <dev-server-command> > .codex_artifacts/logs/devserver.log 2>&1 &
echo $! > .codex_artifacts/logs/devserver.pid
# run checks
kill "$(cat .codex_artifacts/logs/devserver.pid)" || true
```

## Validation cost policy

- Fast gate: every milestone.
- Targeted gate: after behavior changes.
- Full gate: before review freeze.
- E2E / visual: before review freeze or when UI behavior changes.
- Flaky / expensive checks: record but do not loop forever.
